     {
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "Madina? The market was quiet yesterday, right?"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "What about this, then? I wasn't dreaming."
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "A graph is a map of connections. Who is connected to who."
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "panels": [
     {
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "Sixteen seconds."
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "Not bad, the guy from Madina."
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "You… you remember?!"
       },
       {
        "text": "I review everything. All the time. He can't take what I've locked in."
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "The others? He took their memories. Like your signs."
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "bubbles": [
       {
        "text": "Who are you, anyway?"
       },
       {
        "text": "Mory. 2nd year too. Back row."
